<title>SWEDEN: Iceland airport cargo volumes jump 38 pct in Dec.</title>
<headline>Iceland airport cargo volumes jump 38 pct in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iceland's international airport at Keflavik handled 2,089 tonnes of freight in December, a 38 percent rise over the same month a year earlier, Iceland's civil aviation administration said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The administration published the following figures about airport activity for the month.</p>
<p>						    Dec 1996	Dec 1995</p>
<p>KEFLAVIK INT'L AIRPORT</p>
<p> Cargo export (in tonnes)			1,285	     942</p>
<p>	 import					  804	     569</p>
<p> Total						 2,089	   1,511</p>
<p> Mail export (in tonnes)			   109	     108</p>
<p>	import					   157	     162</p>
<p> Total						   266	     270</p>
<p> Passengers					 55,958	  49,605</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
